  = note: tracing-opentelemetry has no i64 histogram: a signed value is silently recorded as an attribute, not a metric
  = note: cast explicitly if you meant it, e.g. `value as u64` or `value as f64`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `switchgear_metrics::value::HistogramValue`:
            f32
            f64
            u16
            u32
            u64
            u8
            usize
