error[E0277]: `i32` cannot be recorded as a monotonic counter value
 --> tests/compile_fail/signed_where_unsigned.rs:6:49
  |
6 |     switchgear_metrics::monotonic_counter!("m", -1i32);
  |     --------------------------------------------^^^^^-
