  = help: the trait `switchgear_metrics::value::MonotonicCounterValue` is not implemented for `i32`
  = note: tracing-opentelemetry casts a signed value to u64 for `monotonic_counter.`, so a negative one wraps to an enormous positive count
  = note: cast explicitly if you meant it, e.g. `value as u64` or `value as f64`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `switchgear_metrics::value::MonotonicCounterValue`:
            f32
            f64
            u16
            u32
            u64
            u8
            usize
